                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                     <locus from="5ra" to="116rb"/>
                     <title type="complete" ref="LIT1097Ammest"/>
                     <textLang mainLang="am"/>
                     
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.1">
                        <locus from="5ra" to="11ra"/>
                        <title ref="LIT1097Ammest#Introduction"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">በስመ፡</hi> <gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/> ብለው፡ መጻሕፍትን፡ እንዲጀምሩ፡ <hi rend="rubric">በአብ፡ ስም፡ ወላዲ፡ በወልድ፡ ስም፡</hi> ተወላዲ፡ በመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ስም፡ ሠራፂ፡ ለአጠይቆ፡ 
                           አካላት፡ ሶስቱን፡ አንድ፡ አንዱን፡ ሶስ<hi rend="rubric">ት፡ ብለን፡ እንጀምራለን። እምቅድ</hi>መ፡ ዓለም፡ ከአብ፡ ያለናት፡ መወለዱ፡ አንድ፡ ልደት። በ<hi rend="rubric">ዚህ፡ ዓለም፡ ከመቤታችን፡ ያለአባ</hi>ት፡ መወለዱ፡ ሁለት፡ ልደት። 
                           ወልደ፡ አብ፡ ወልደ፡ ማርያም፡ በተዋህዶ፡ ከበረ። <gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/></incipit> 
                     </msItem>

                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.2">
                        <locus from="11ra" to="25ra"/>
                        <title ref="LIT1097Ammest#Trinity"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="am"><hi rend="rubric">ምሥጢረ፡ ሥላሴስ፡ እንደምን፡ ነው፡ ቢ</hi>ሉ። ሶስትነታቸውን፡ አንድነታቸውን፡ መማር፡ ማወቅ፡ ነው።  ፫ትነታችውስ፡ በምንና፡ በምን፡ ነው፡ ቢሉ፡ በስም፡ በግብር፡ በአካል፡ ነው። 
                           የስም፡ ፫ትነታችውስ፡ እንደምን፡ ነው፡ ቢሉ፡ <hi rend="rubric">አብ፡ ወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡</hi> ነው። <gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/></incipit>
                     </msItem>
                     
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.3">
                        <locus from="25ra" to="49ra"/>
                        <title ref="LIT1097Ammest#Incarnation"/>
                        <note>This section includes a discussion on the theology of Qǝbāt and Ṣaggā schools, on <locus from="45rb" to="47va"/>.</note>
                        <incipit xml:lang="am"><hi rend="rubric">ምሥጢረ፡ ሥጋዌ፡ በስመ፡</hi><gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/> ምሥጢረ፡ ሥላሴንስ፡ ነገርኸኝና፡ ምሥጢረ፡ ሥጋዌ፡ እንደምን፡ ነው፡ ቢሉ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ጌታ፡</hi> በልቡናው፡ 
                           ያሰበውን፡ በነቢያት፡ ያናገረውን፡ ለመፈጸም፡ ንግበር፡ ሰብአ፡ በአርአያነ፡ ወበአምሳሊነ፡ ብለው፡ <hi rend="rubric">ሥላሴ፡</hi> አዳምን፡ ካ፬ቱ፡ ባሕርያት፡ ፈጠሩት፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/></incipit>
                     </msItem>

                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.4">
                        <locus from="49ra" to="68vb"/>
                        <title ref="LIT1097Ammest#BaptismMystery"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="am"><hi rend="rubric">ምሥጢረ፡ ጥምቀት፡ ምሥጢረ፡ ሥጋዌንስ፡ ነገርኸኝና፡</hi> ምሥጢረ፡ ጥምቀት፡ እንደምን፡ <supplied reason="omitted" resp="MK">ነው፡</supplied> ቢሉ፡ ጌታ፡ ከመቤታችን፡ በተወለደ፡ በ፴ዓመት፡ 
                           በዮርዳኖስ፡ ተጠምቀ፡ በበህቅ፡ ልኅቀ፡ በ፴ክረምት፡ በዮርዳኖስ፡ ተጠምቀ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/></incipit>
                     </msItem>
                     
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.5">
                        <locus from="68vb" to="73vb"/>
                        <title ref="LIT6940IncarnationAmh"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="am"><hi rend="rubric">በስመ፡</hi> የትስብእትና፡ የመለኮት፡ ተዋህዶ፡ እንዴት፡ ነው፡ ቢሉ፡ አዳም፡ <hi rend="rubric">ሥላሴ፡</hi> ያዘዙትን፡ ትእዛዝ፡ ቢያፈርስ፡ ሞተ፡ ሥጋ፡ ሞተ፡ 
                           ነፍስ፡ ተፈርዶበት፡ ሲኖር፡ ከ<hi rend="rubric">ሥላሴ፡</hi> ምሕረት፡ አይለይምና፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/></incipit>
                     </msItem>
                     
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.6">
                        <locus from="73vb" to="83va"/>
                        <title ref="LIT1097Ammest#Eucharist"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="am"><hi rend="rubric">ምሥጢረ፡ ቍርባን፡ በስመ፡</hi> <gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/> ምሥጢረ፡ ጥምቀትንስ፡ ነገርኸኝና፡ ምሥጢረ፡ ቁርባን፡ እንደምነው፡ ቢሉ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ጌታ፡</hi> የጸሎተ፡ ሐሙስ፡ ዕለት፡ ከአልአዛር፡ ቤት፡ ነውም፡ ቢሉ፡
                           ከኒቆዲሞስ፡ ቤት፡ ነውም፡ ቢሉ፡ መሥዋዕተ፡ ኦሪትን፡ ሽሮ፡ መሥዋዕተ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ወንጌልን፡</hi> ሾመላቸው። መሥዋዕተ፡ ኦሪትስ፡ ምን፡ ነበር፡ ቢሉ፡ ሜል፡ ገች፡ በግ፡ ይሠዉ፡ ነበር።<gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/></incipit>
                     </msItem>
                     
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.7">
                        <locus from="83va" to="124v"/>
                        <title ref="LIT1097Ammest#Resurrection"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="am"><hi rend="rubric">ምሥጢረ፡ ትንሣኤው፡ ምሥጢረ፡ ቁርባንስ፡  ነገርኸኝና፡ ምሥጢ</hi>ረ፡ ትንሣኤ፡ ሙታን፡ እንደምነው፡ ቢሉ፡ ጌታ፡ 
                           የጸሎተ፡ <add place="above">ሐሙስ፡</add> ዕለት፡ ከአልአዛርም፡ ቤት፡ ነው፡ ቢሉ፡ ከኒቆዲሞስም፡ ቤት፡ ነው፡ ቢሉ፡ መሥዋዕተ፡ ኦሪትን፡ ሽሮ፡ መሥዋዕተ፡ ወንጌልን፡ ሹሞላቸው። 
                           ሐዋርያትን፡ አስከተሉ፡ ወደጌቴሴማን፡ ሔደ፡ ከዚያም፡ ደርሶ፡ ጴጥሮስን፡ ዮሐንስን፡ ያዕቆ<supplied reason="omitted" resp="MK">ብ</supplied>ን፡ አስከትሎ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" xml:lang="gez"/>
                          </incipit>
                     </msItem>
                     
                     <colophon xml:id="coloph1">
                        <locus from="115vb" to="116ra"/>
                        <foreign xml:lang="gez">ተፈጸመ፡ በሰላመ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ አመ፳ወ፯፡ ለጥር፡ ወበመዋዕሊሁ፡ ለንጉሥነ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ኃይለ፡ ሥላሴ፡</hi> ወንግሥትነ፡ ወለተ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ጊዮርጊስ፡</hi> ወእንዘ፡ ሊቀ፡ ጳጳስነ፡ አባ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ባስልዮስ፡</hi>
                           ወብፁዕ፡ ጳጳስነ፡ አባ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ዮሐንስ።</hi> ወእንዘ፡ ንቡረ፡ እድነ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ወልደ፡ ኢየሱስ፡</hi> ወእንዘ፡ ገበዝነ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ተክለ፡ ሃይማኖት፡</hi> በ፲፱፻፶፩
                           ዓ፡ ምሕ፡ <hi rend="rubric">አክሱም</hi></foreign> 
                        <foreign xml:lang="en">It was completed by the peace of God on the 27th of Ṭǝrr during the reign of our King Ḫāyla Śǝllāse and our Queen Walatta Giyorgis, and while our Metropolitan was
                           ʾAbbā Bāsǝlyos and our bishop his grace ʾAbbā Yoḥannǝs, while our Nǝbura ʾƎd Walda ʾIyasus and our gabaz Takla Hāymānot, on 1951 year of grace, ʾAksum.</foreign>
                           <locus target="#116rb"/> 
                           <foreign xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">ለዝ፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ዘአጽሐፎ፡ በ፴ብር፡ አባ፡ ደብረ፡ ጽዮን፡ ወስመ፡ አቡሁ፡ ወልደ፡ አናንያ፡ ወስመ፡ እሙ፡ ወለተ፡ ጊዮርጊስ</hi></foreign>
                        <foreign xml:lang="en">The one who had this book written for 30 bǝrr was ʾAbbā Dabra Ṣǝyon, whose father’s name was Walda ʾAnānyā and whose mother’s name was Walatta Giyorgis.</foreign>
                        
                        <note>The colophon states that the codex was completed during the reign of <persName ref="PRS5226haylase"><roleName type="title">King</roleName> Ḫāyla Śǝllāse</persName> (r. 1930–1974)
                           and <persName ref="PRS6642MananAs"><roleName type="title">Queen</roleName> Manan</persName> who is evoked with her baptismal name Walatta Giyorgis in 
                           <date calendar="ethiopian" when-custom="1951-05-27" when="1959-02-04">27 Ṭǝrr 1951 A.M. (= 4 February 1959 A.D.)</date>. 
                           Additionally, other ecclesiastics in office at that time are mentioned:
                           <persName ref="PRS2533Baselyos"><roleName type="rank">Patriarch</roleName> Bāsǝlyos</persName>, 
                           <persName ref="PRS15545Yohannes"><roleName type="rank">Bishop</roleName> <roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Yoḥannǝs</persName>, 
                           <persName ref="PRS15546WaldaIyasus"><roleName type="function">Nǝbura ʾƎd</roleName> Walda ʾIyasus</persName>, 
                           and <persName ref="PRS15547TaklaHayman"><roleName type="function">gabaz</roleName> Takla Hāymānot</persName>. 
                           According to the second part of the colophon, the manuscript was commissioned by <persName ref="PRS15548DabraSeyon"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Dabra Ṣǝyon</persName> for 30 bǝrr.
                           The commissioner’s parents are also mentioned: <persName ref="PRS15549WaldaAnanya">Walda ʾAnānyā</persName> and <persName ref="PRS15550WalattaGiyorgis">Walatta Giyorgis</persName>.
                           </note>
                     </colophon>
                  </msItem>
                   
